_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5e1f9028253dacba096bf715f7397a87c3f70d70", "message": "Post-new-MacBook Updates (#83)\n\n* Move more apps to XDG directories\n* Various package updates\n* Refactored default variables in `cloud` role\n* Improved `tmux_config` variable for organization\n* New task to remove specified dotfiles\n* Will now setup Atuin sync\n* Fixed `install` script POSIX compatibility\n* Removed app icons that are no longer needed\n* Add Solarized Light theme to `eza` and Ghostty", "created_at": "2025-03-16T21:01:35Z", "repo": "ansible", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "24ded6a490b7a7dc35de4d266967362cd7393835", "message": "chore(vim): move rc files to XDG spec", "created_at": "2025-03-04T15:44:14Z", "repo": "ansible", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "91793996970218c28b24f9dc46c7c64d6a7ff823", "message": "fix(xdg_cleanup): add missing comma to list", "created_at": "2025-03-04T15:10:51Z", "repo": "ansible", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f3e497f6b9a9e28e765470ab5cd535151fa01697", "message": "chore: tweak Atuin config", "created_at": "2025-03-03T16:19:28Z", "repo": "ansible", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b3667ec8ea8ab55adcf520cb888025efde989341", "message": "Bug fixes and improvements (#82)\n\n* Package updates for Fedora compatibility\n* Convert `dnf` modules to `dnf5`\n* Migrate Zsh configs to `~/.config/zsh`\n* Improved Zsh task tags\n* Add more program XDG environment variable", "created_at": "2025-03-02T22:42:16Z", "repo": "ansible", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "61de69744f3c7115e949ce23a359ad1484cf830f", "message": "Squash some bugs, do some cleanup (#81)\n\n* Break out config tasks in `git` module\n* Actually call the `dotfiles` module in playbooks (whoops)\n* Make a `.gitconfig` exception for diff style in older versions of Git\n* No longer explicitly set XDG vars for macOS (not needed)", "created_at": "2025-02-13T18:36:39Z", "repo": "ansible", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "95fc725cc952e82055f7b7444c118432a9fc6127", "message": "Reintroduce dotfiles & 1Password backend (#80)\n\n* Merged all dotfiles back into the repo\n* Inventory now dynamic and not templated per host\n* Personalized roles at the cost of reduced modularity\n* Eliminated Vault usage in favor of using 1Password\n* Introduced \"global variables\" declared in `host_vars`\n* Repo layout now flat and more simplistic\n* `install` no longer uses flags but customizable via environment variables", "created_at": "2025-02-12T11:57:57Z", "repo": "ansible", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "250e0082b8e4d8b6914a455490091b03b551210e", "message": "feat(docker): a new role to install Docker", "created_at": "2025-01-09T14:06:43Z", "repo": "ansible", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8a8828c27a10b8c82a9cd025a68b408a1895590f", "message": "feat(tmux): improve tmux profile support", "created_at": "2024-11-12T18:51:06Z", "repo": "ansible", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "79e53c459d4a436c949bb591d18548bea03a958e", "message": "feat(pipx): set a default index_url", "created_at": "2024-10-30T15:58:32Z", "repo": "ansible", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e3a2a67a70e43470b02e058482e100c8a32a91b4", "message": "feat(macos): remove gatekeeper config", "created_at": "2024-10-29T19:22:48Z", "repo": "ansible", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "616f623d850f6d3fc1246763ebf7b4a30511df83", "message": "feat(roles): consolidate into new 'desktop' role\n\nMerged 'dock', 'fonts', and 'logi' roles into 'desktop' which already included the